{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的大块直接交代离开的理由、怀念的对象、独自承担的代价，以及最后不为留人再吞委屈的选择，整曲主线更容易只靠大字串起来；Y 的高亮多是散落的局部短语，单看不够完整。small：判平，X 的感受更贴近人物当下，但部分意象相近；Y 的补充更细，却有一些从人物体验转向音乐描写，优劣相抵；fine：X 更好，感受主要落在胸口、脚步、呼吸等具体体验上，Y 则有较多和弦、旋律、节奏本身的描述。concise：X 更好，Y 在怀念亲近、担心孤单、是否回去等内容上反复铺陈；human：Y 更自然，X 的“对亲近关系更具体的盼望”“未来还会有亲近”“被判成全好或全坏”等表达偏抽象、书面。load：Y 更好，高亮大字的总量明显较少，虽然分散的短语更多，但各屏停留时间基本足够扫读；X 的完整大块在部分短时屏幕上阅读量相对较大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21cc15ad-f9d0-4030-84bb-fa2b1568e60f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T192451685729Z", "elapsed_seconds": 330.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:30:22.559369+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f782aab216b66895f1d73edfeb730e231de147eafd9f8fe4c1d11ef7d78be4ce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23e